    {
      "id": "claim_63861acb8731459882fd0254887c92c7",
      "statement": "Severity is ordered low < medium < high < critical (SEVERITY_ORDER); filter_findings_for_publish surfaces only open findings at or above the severity_threshold (default medium), sorted severity-descending then file/line, capped at REVIEW_FINDING_CAP (6). Confidence is recorded per finding but does not gate publication.",
